    aim idle, run, primary/secondary shots, line shot, retreat shot.'
  vfxRead: LinePressure projectile cues remain explicit and are not hidden behind
    a static turret overlay.
  reuseJustification: Candidate keeps role behavior in data so the same pattern/deck
    contract can be reused by future summon AI.
